concepts.statement:
The collection
\[
\mathcal{F}^{\mathrm{co}}
=
\left\{
A \subseteq I : I \setminus A \text{ is finite}
\right\}
\]
is the cofinite filter on \(I\), and is proper iff \(I\) is infinite.
\(\mathcal{F}^{\mathrm{co}}\) is not an ultrafilter.

